# Preview Component Docs

Doc pages live in `preview/pages/components/`. Shell components in `preview/components/doc/` (preview-only, not published).

Reference: `preview/pages/components/ComboboxPage.tsx`.

## Page structure (fixed order)

1. `ComponentDocLayout` — title + description
2. Multiple `DocSection` — one composition per variant (top → bottom)
3. `PropsTable` — API reference at the bottom

Right sidebar **table of contents** is automatic when sections register an `id`.

## DocSection contract

Each variant / composition:

| Prop | Required | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | Recommended | URL hash + TOC (`react-hook-form` not auto-slug friendly) |
| `title` | Yes | Section heading + TOC label |
| `description` | Optional | Short usage note |
| `code` | Recommended | Copyable snippet for Code tab |
| `children` | Yes | Live demo (Preview tab) |

URL examples:

```text
/components/combobox#controlled
/components/combobox#props
```

If `id` is omitted, `slugifySectionTitle(title)` is used.

## Preview / Code tabs

- Pass `code` on `DocSection` → wraps children in `DocExample`
- Code strings: valid TSX, import from `'self-component'`, include minimal setup (`items`, state)
- Keep demo and snippet in sync when API changes
- Snippets are **documentation**, not executed — may simplify vs live demo

## Props table

- Define `PropDocRow[]` next to the page component
- Columns: Prop, Type, Default, Description, Notes
- Use `relatedTypes` for nested types (`ComboboxItem`, `*Field` extras)
- `PropsTable` defaults: `id="props"`, `title="Props"`

## Recommended sections per component type

**Form control:** Default → Controlled → Uncontrolled → RHF (`*Field`) → Sizes → Disabled → States (error) → Props

**Display-only:** Default → Variants → Composition → Props

## Checklist (new doc page)

- [ ] `preview/pages/components/<Name>Page.tsx`
- [ ] Register in `preview/config/navigation.ts`
- [ ] Explicit `id` on every `DocSection`
- [ ] `code` string per section
- [ ] `PropsTable` + `relatedTypes` if needed
- [ ] Visual check: TOC sticky, hash scroll, Copy works

See `preview/pages/components/README.md` and `preview/components/doc/README.md`.
